/-!
# The Fischer group `Fi₂₂` satisfies the permutation-labelling criterion

`Fi22` acts on 3510 points (point stabilizer `2·U₆(2)`), rank 3, suborbits `1, 693, 2816`, through the ATLAS permutation representation. The certificate
`CFSGOutside.HallPaige.Sporadic.Fi22Data.cert` is checked by the kernel, in pieces; with the corpus bound
`Nat.card Fi22.Group ≤ 64561751654400` it identifies the subgroup generated by the certificate's
stabilizer elements with the full point stabilizer (`CFSGOutside.HallPaige.PermKit.permLabelling_of_certOK`).
-/

